WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000 line:18 position:50% size:80% align:middle
Are you a cocktail lover who's vegan, gluten intolerant, or trying to cut down on sugar?

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000 line:18 position:50% size:80% align:middle
Then you have to try craft mix variety packs. They come in four flavors that are all in single

00:08.000 --> 00:13.000 line:18 position:50% size:80% align:middle
serving packets with five grams of sugar and 25 calories apiece. They are ready in three simple

00:13.000 --> 00:17.000 line:18 position:50% size:80% align:middle
steps and double as a great mocktail mixer if you're searching for ways to reduce alcohol.

00:18.000 --> 00:23.000 line:18 position:50% size:80% align:middle
Just add ice, a spirit of your choice, and water sparkling, and mix in a packet for that bar fresh

00:23.000 --> 00:28.000 line:18 position:50% size:80% align:middle
taste. I just made a mango margarita and it took me a little longer than 10 seconds.
